##! Please refer to the documentation at
##! https://coreruleset.org/docs/development/regex_assembly/.

##! The command must fill its own line: it follows the line break directly, and
##! nothing but spaces may follow it before the next line break or the end of the
##! value. POP3 (RFC 1939) has no command tags, so a word before the command is
##! prose ("...\r\nplease quit"), not a tag. Tagged commands are IMAP, see 932310.
##!+ i
##!^ \r\n
##!$ [ \t]*(?:[\r\n]|$)

##! POP3 Commands - PL3

##! POP3 Commands - No args
QUIT
STAT
NOOP
RSET
CAPA
